    "prompt": "In a cozy pixel art recording nook, Polli wears tiny headphones beside two retro microphones labeled MAI-Voice-2.1 and Flash, while a CRT monitor robot watches soft sound waves curl around code-plants and a prominent lime green (#ecf874) glow warms the pastel room. The main character is a cute pixel art bee mascot with a yellow body and dark brown horizontal stripes, small black legs, two black antennae, black vertical oval eyes, bright pink rectangular blush marks on cheeks, a small happy smile, and small rounded light blue translucent wings; she is small-to-medium sized, sharing the frame rather than dominating it, strictly pixel art and never realistic, in cozy pixel art, 8-bit aesthetic, soft pastel gradients, warm lighting, retro gaming vibes."
